<comment>
rsgg25-1019 (worker RSGG25, USER 2026-10-19 "rsg g25 ... our own ic with our eos and our mesa opacity table ... resolution higher
          than arepo"; USER N=128 go): RSG g25 = MESA r15140 golden25 profile438 (Orion m22_p438.data; M 20.54 Msun, L 1.79e5 Lsun,
          R_ph 843.8 Rsun, Teff 4088 K, X 0.6538 Z 0.0198) on the He giant 14p5M PRODUCTION method (/raven/ptmp/jinma/hg145_prod_1018/decks/hg145_prod.athinput), cs full sphere N=128,
          r 0.03-3 R_ph (x1min in the radiative zone below the CZ base 0.0494 R_ph), 591 radial cells. IC tools/ic_star mode mesa +
          mesa_kap (gs98/lowT_fa05_gs98 X 0.654 Zbase 0.02 everywhere in the domain) + anchor mass. See /raven/ptmp/jinma/rsg_g25_1019/NOTE.md.
          The He giant <comment> text below is HISTORY of the template.
hegiant-1013 FIN3 PRODUCTION (HG, user 2026-10-13): this He giant (MESA r15140 M2pt754_Porb100 profile29 from S. Wu,
          IC column ic_giant_own.txt md5 ddc72692) on the FIN3 production method = the AG Car E1 FINAL <rad_m1> block
          (dic-prod-1013 dad00933) and the E1 IC/BC/floor recipe; every changed line is tagged hegiant-1013.
          Old method text below is HISTORY (10-09 deck).
problem = He GIANT envelope before core collapse (MESA r15140 M2pt754_Porb100 profile29, Wu grid: M 2.556 Msun,
          L_ph 1.62e4 Lsun, R_ph 61.78 Rsun, Teff 8.28 kK), FOLLOW THE EXPANSION. he_star_m1 on branch hegiant-1006:
          he_gm_column (enclosed-mass gravity of the IC column, static), he_base_heat (wall in the CZ: the
          scaffold's wall luminosity L_MLT(3 Rsun) 6.72e6 Lsun stays as a 0.5 Rsun base heating layer). IC : MESA T(r) + HSE with our EOS and
          our m(r) (ic/make_ic_giant_mesa.py --hse own), frozen MLT scaffold F - F_diff, RE atmosphere, floor 1e-20.
          General EOS X 0 Y 0.9265 (Z 0.0735 inert, a_metal 1.77 : fully ionized metals); TOPS tables of the
          envelope/surface mixtures blended in log T (tables/blend_tables.py). r 3-200 Rsun N445 (grid/fit_445:
          dr : max(0.015 r, 0.15 Rsun) deep, plateau ~0.039 Rsun : H_atm/3 over 60.3-64.2 Rsun, dr/r <: 0.01 to
          130 Rsun). pi/3 x pi/3 wedge, 128 x 128 SCOUT layout (16 blocks 445 x 32 x 32). See SETUP.md.
          FRESH N897 (10-09, user: start the He giant from fresh before the remap): t = 0 from the same IC
          column (rebuilt bitwise, md5 ddc72692) directly on the N897 grid (fine band 60-95 Rsun,
          grid/fit2_897.out), 4 blocks 897 x 64 x 64, with the 10-09 production radiation (half-range VET,
          BLENDALL.md idort_f36 x30; vet_gd_twin + noesrc + fuse/det; vet_scatter ma, kappa_e eos; F2/F3)
          and the N897 keys (implicit_opac_newton false: He cliff, HEGIANT_PICARD.md; sp_x2_periodic_image).
          See fresh_1009/FRESH_1009.md.
hg145-1015 (worker HG145, USER 10-15 "14p5M first with a production setting"): MESA r15140 14p5M_widebinary_profile14
          (S. Wu; f4cb70aa; He star 2.754 Msun, R_ph 109.85 Rsun, L 3.71e4 Lsun, Teff 7.64 kK, thermal equilibrium above ~3 Rsun)
          on the hgF4w production recipe (FIN4 deck 1b4d0592 + tlim 1e9 + dt_retry + ROL2U, binary fin51-r-fix b16b66db).
          r 8-355.6 Rsun, nx1 704; IC make_ic_hg145.py (--hse own, F_MLT = max(0, F - F_r)); every change tagged hg145-1015.
          The text below about profile29 / 3-200 Rsun is HISTORY of the template.
hg145-1015-e1 (v2, USER 10-15): IC = MESA T(P) re-integrated in HSE with our EOS + code gravity (ic3), ext2 tables,
          E1 in-code IC chain (sph1d, re_atm, atm_force module, he_ic_equil) + E1 ramp rule; see NOTE.md sec. 6.
hgprod-1018 (worker HGPROD, USER 2026-10-18 "I want the he giant prod soon"; USER: 704 grid, old He giant production layout,
          production check = the 1-2 d screen + background smoke): 14p5M PRODUCTION deck = decks/hg145_mk_nobh.athinput
          (hg145_mscaf_1017, md5 see NOTE) + problem/mlt_closure = adaptive (the screened candidate, mltp-1017 machinery,
          binary prodmerge-1018-hg) + <rad_m1>/vet_gd_twin_lowmem = true (layout/memory key of hegiant_fin4_raven).
          MESA-kap opacity (ic-mesascaf-1017 opacity.mesa_kap, table opac_mk_afe2dd8da2bd), MESA-anchored IC (re_zone hopf).
          No he_base_heat (adaptive refuses it; wall F_MLT 4.5e11 = 1.2 % of F at r_in, see NOTE). Every change tagged hgprod-1018.
